<div>
    <div class=3D"cmp-text is-really-first">
        <p>I spend most of my year in conversations with technology leaders=
, asking what=E2=80=99s working, what isn=E2=80=99t, and what keeps them up=
 at night. Lately, those conversations have taken on a different quality.</=
p>
<p>The question used to be =E2=80=9CWhat can we do with AI?=E2=80=9D Now it=
=E2=80=99s =E2=80=9CHow do we move from experimentation to impact?=E2=80=9D=
 The focus has moved from endless pilots to real business value, and there=
=E2=80=99s a sense of urgency behind it all. Not because the technology is =
getting better=E2=80=94though it is=E2=80=94but because the pace of change =
itself has accelerated.</p>

    </div>
