<div>
    <div class=3D"cmp-text ">
        <p>The numbers tell the story (figure 1). The telephone took 50 yea=
rs to reach 50 million users. The internet took seven years. A leading gene=
rative AI tool reached about twice that many in two months.<sup><a href=3D"=
https://www.deloitte.com/us/en/insights/topics/technology-management/tech-t=
rends.html#endnote-1" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 1">1</a></sup=
> As of this writing, that tool has over 800 million weekly users=E2=80=94r=
oughly 10% of the planet=E2=80=99s population.<sup><a href=3D"https://www.d=
eloitte.com/us/en/insights/topics/technology-management/tech-trends.html#en=
dnote-2" aria-label=3D"Endnotes reference number 2">2</a></sup></p>

    </div>
</div>

